        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "If, due to a grievance denial, arbitration is invoked by either party, relevant documents, reports and evidence relied upon will be exchanged by both parties during the scheduled arbitration. All information will be considered privileged and confidential and will not be used for any other purpose except for invoking arbitration.",
            "block_bbox": [
                133,
                189,
                1065,
                303
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": 2,
            "group_id": 1,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    133.0,
                    189.0
                ],
                [
                    1065.0,
                    189.0
                ],
                [
                    1065.0,
                    303.0
                ],
                [
                    133.0,
                    303.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "Section 12.8 – Arbitration",
            "block_bbox": [
                134,
                327,
                433,
                356
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    134.0,
                    327.0
                ],
                [
                    433.0,
                    327.0
                ],
                [
                    433.0,
                    356.0
                ],
                [
                    134.0,
                    356.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. Any grievance, which is not resolved shall be subject to binding arbitration (as permitted by law), which may be invoked only by the Union or the Employer.",
            "block_bbox": [
                133,
                383,
                1005,
                442
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    133.0,
                    383.0
                ],
                [
                    1005.0,
                    383.0
                ],
                [
                    1005.0,
                    442.0
                ],
                [
                    133.0,
                    442.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. Within 15 working days after The Adjutant General issues his final decision concerning a grievance, the Union or the Employer should provide written notification to the other party informing them that the grievance has been submitted for arbitration.",
            "block_bbox": [
                131,
                466,
                1077,
                553
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    131.0,
                    466.0
                ],
                [
                    1077.0,
                    466.0
                ],
                [
                    1077.0,
                    553.0
                ],
                [
                    131.0,
                    553.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. If either party questions whether the matter is subject to arbitration because of alleged conflict with applicable existing law or circumstances, the Arbitrator will determine the question of whether the matter is subject to arbitration.",
            "block_bbox": [
                131,
                576,
                1009,
                663
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    131.0,
                    576.0
                ],
                [
                    1009.0,
                    576.0
                ],
                [
                    1009.0,
                    663.0
                ],
                [
                    131.0,
                    663.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "Section 12.9 – Arbitrator Selection",
            "block_bbox": [
                132,
                688,
                534,
                716
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    132.0,
                    688.0
                ],
                [
                    534.0,
                    688.0
                ],
                [
                    534.0,
                    716.0
                ],
                [
                    132.0,
                    716.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. The party invoking arbitration will request from the Federal Mediation and Conciliation Service (FMCS) a list of 10 impartial persons qualified to serve as Arbitrators. A copy of the request will be provided to the other party as notification of arbitration.",
            "block_bbox": [
                130,
                743,
                1040,
                857
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 7,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    130.0,
                    743.0
                ],
                [
                    1040.0,
                    743.0
                ],
                [
                    1040.0,
                    857.0
                ],
                [
                    130.0,
                    857.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. Within 10 days of receiving the list, both parties will alternately strike the name from the list until only 1 name remains. The individual's name remaining will be duly selected to hear the grievance. The party invoking arbitration will strike the first name.",
            "block_bbox": [
                128,
                882,
                1074,
                970
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 9,
            "group_id": 8,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    128.0,
                    882.0
                ],
                [
                    1074.0,
                    882.0
                ],
                [
                    1074.0,
                    970.0
                ],
                [
                    128.0,
                    970.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. If either party fails to participate in the selection process, the arbitration action will proceed with the requesting party accomplishing the selection. The parties agree that if the selected Arbitrator is unavailable to hear the grievance within 45 days the parties may select a new Arbitrator using the above procedures.",
            "block_bbox": [
                128,
                993,
                1072,
                1108
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 10,
            "group_id": 9,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    128.0,
                    993.0
                ],
                [
                    1072.0,
                    993.0
                ],
                [
                    1072.0,
                    1108.0
                ],
                [
                    128.0,
                    1108.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4. Arbitration will normally be conducted during duty hours at a Joint Force Headquarters (JFHQ) to accommodate the maximum number of participants.",
            "block_bbox": [
                128,
                1132,
                960,
                1191
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": 11,
            "group_id": 10,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    128.0,
                    1132.0
                ],
                [
                    960.0,
                    1132.0
                ],
                [
                    960.0,
                    1191.0
                ],
                [
                    128.0,
                    1191.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "5. Any participant who is scheduled for a shift other than the day shift may request to change shifts so that he or she may attend. Mission requirements permitting, such requests will not unreasonably be denied.",
            "block_bbox": [
                127,
                1215,
                1051,
                1302
            ],
            "block_id": 11,
            "block_order": 12,
            "group_id": 11,
            "block_polygon_points": [
